The `closeStdout` helper fixes three subtle bugs reviewer caught:
1. Double-Wait: `cmd.Wait` called multiple times returns `ErrWaitAlready` (undefined). The `alreadyClosed` guard ensures exactly one Wait per invocation regardless of exit path.
